        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Composed of three parts. A red cotton waistband joined to a strip of acheik (horizontal wave patterned) silk textile in navy, yellow and light red to which is attached a separately woven pink silk train partly patterned with fine horizontal stripes of light red, violet, maroon and yellow.  These components are handstitched together."@en , "Burmese multi-coloured cotton and silk hta-mein. Konbaung Dynasty (1752-1885). Acheik-luntaya patterned area."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/630bb3af-426a-3350-95dc-6025b2bf93c8> ;
